              </h2>

              <p class="letter-salutation" id="letterSalutationText">Dear bestie,</p>
              
              <div class="letter-body" id="letterBodyText">
Happy Birthday, Bestie! ❤️

I honestly don't know how to put into words how grateful I am to have you in my life. Thank you for being my biggest supporter, my partner in crime, and the person I can always count on.

Through all the laughs, random talks, late night rants, and endless inside jokes, you have made every single day brighter and so much more special.

On your birthday, I wish you all the happiness, joy, and success in the whole wide world! Keep shining bright like you always do!
              </div>

              <div class="letter-signoff" id="letterSignoffText">
                Forever your biggest cheerleader 💌✨
              </div>

